invalid type: string "3. REMOTE WORK AND HYBRID POLICY\n3.1 Eligibility: After completing the 90-day probationary period, employees are eligible for the hybrid work model.\n3.2 Hybrid Schedule: Eligible employees may work remotely up to 3 days per week. Tuesdays and Thursdays are mandatory in-office days for all local staff.\nonline and available for meetings during the \"core hours\"Ld 6iÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿ